            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.22

- Hydrates live thread metadata when turn and status notifications arrive before the thread appears in the recent-thread list.
- Keeps live-discovered threads visible while waiting for the authoritative thread list to catch up.
- Packages SwiftPM resource bundles from the product link metadata so dependency resource bundles are included reliably.
]]></description>
